## Contact Details

AeroSports Scarborough is located at one thousand one hundred twenty Birchmount Road, Scarborough, Ontario, M1K 5G4. You can reach them by phone at two eight nine-four-five-four-five-five-five-five or by extension three for park inquiries. For event-related questions, email events.scb@aerosportsparks.ca. The contact manager is Scott or Rachit. More information about AeroSports Scarborough can be found on their website at https://www.aerosportsparks.ca.

[2] (source: location_info.md)
## Useful Links

For booking activities or parties, visit the main booking page at https://ecom.roller.app/aerosportsscarborough/products/en/home. If you are interested in organizing a birthday party, use this specific link: https://ecom.roller.app/aerosportsscarborough/birthdayparties/en/products. To access and complete necessary waivers, go to https://waiver.roller.app/aerosportsscarborough/. For directions or to view the location on Google Maps, visit https://g.page/AeroSports-scarborough. Birthday invitations can be created at https://aerosportsinvitation.netlify.app/invitationscarborough.

[3] (source: passes.md)
## Annual Pass

For frequent visitors, the Annual Pass provides a year-long option, staying valid for three hundred sixty-five days from the purchase date. This pass is priced at three hundred sixty-four dollars and ninety cents plus tax, with each visit allowing sixty minutes of jumping time.

[4] (source: group_bookings.md)
## Room Rentals

For those interested in renting specific areas within AeroSports Scarborough, several options are available:

- Party Rooms (1, 2, 3, or 4) can be rented for one hundred dollars per forty-five minutes. Each room accommodates between twenty-five to thirty people.
  
- The Birds Eye Party Arena is available for two hundred dollars per forty-five minutes and has a capacity of eighty people.

These rental options provide flexibility for hosting various events within the facility.

[5] (source: jump_prices.md)
### Open Jump Passes

AeroSports Scarborough offers various open jump passes tailored to different age groups and preferences.

- **Premium Jump Pass**: For guests aged six years and older, the Premium Jump Pass costs twenty-four dollars and ninety cents for ninety minutes. This pass grants access to all attractions except Go Karting, Laser Tag, Bazooka Ball, and Mini Golf.
  
- **VIP Jump Pass**: Also available for guests aged six years and older, the VIP Jump Pass is priced at twenty-nine dollars and ninety cents for a duration of one hundred and twenty minutes. Similar to the Premium Jump Pass, it includes access to all attractions except Go Karting, Laser Tag, Bazooka Ball, and Mini Golf.

- **Premium Jump Pass for Ages 2 to 5**: Children aged two to five can enjoy the same benefits as older guests with this pass, which costs twenty-four dollars and ninety cents for ninety minutes. It includes access to all attractions except Go Karting, Laser Tag, Bazooka Ball, and Mini Golf.

- **VIP Jump Pass for Ages 2 to 5**: This pass is available for children aged two to five at a cost of twenty-nine dollars and ninety cents for one hundred and twenty minutes. It provides the same access as the VIP Jump Pass for older guests.

- **Ultimate Jump Pass**: Designed for guests aged six years and older, the Ultimate Jump Pass costs forty-nine dollars and ninety cents for one hundred and eighty minutes. This pass includes access to all core attractions, with the option to choose between Go Karting or Mini Golf and Laser Tag or Bazooka Ball.

- **Passes for Children Under 2**: Any jump pass is free for children under two years old, provided they are accompanied by a paying adult. The duration matches that of the accompanying adult's pass.

- **All Day Pass**: Available to all guests, the All Day Jump Pass costs thirty-nine dollars and ninety cents and allows unlimited access to attractions throughout the day.

[6] (source: group_bookings.md)
## Facility Rentals

AeroSports Scarborough offers facility rentals for exclusive access to the entire venue. The rental fee is four thousand dollars per sixty minutes from Monday to Thursday, and five thousand dollars per sixty minutes during weekends. These rentals accommodate up to two hundred and twenty jumpers with private access and dedicated staff on-site.

Included in the facility rental are jump socks, all party rooms, and cutlery. However, food and catering services incur additional costs. Unlimited go-karting is also included as part of the facility rental package.

[7] (source: group_bookings.md)
## Corporate & Team Parties

AeroSports Scarborough offers corporate and team parties suitable for various occasions such as team-building events, milestone celebrations, and employee rewards. These gatherings take place in an energetic environment featuring trampoline courts, obstacle courses, and more. Customizable packages are available to cater to specific needs.

For booking a corporate event, interested parties can call 289-454-5555 or send an email to events.scb@aerosportsparks.ca for further assistance and package details.


